<section class="privacy-policy">
  <details>
    <summary>Privacy Policy</summary>
    <div class="policy-body">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated: January 30, 2026</strong></p>

      <p>
        Almstins ("we", "us", "our") operates the website almstins.com and any related services
        (collectively, the "Service").
      </p>

      <p>
        We take your privacy seriously. This policy explains what information we collect, why, how
        we use it, and what we do <strong>not</strong> do with it.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect only the minimum data necessary to operate the Service and understand whether it
        is useful.
      </p>

      <h3>Authentication &amp; Account Data</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Email address (if you sign in with email or magic link)</li>
        <li>Name and profile picture (if provided by Google or GitHub login)</li>
        <li>Internal user ID and session tokens (to keep you logged in)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Wallet &amp; Usage Data (when you add/connect wallets)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Public wallet addresses you choose to add</li>
        <li>On-chain data we fetch about those wallets (transactions, balances, positions, etc.)</li>
        <li>Aggregated internal statistics:</li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
        <li>Number of unique wallets per user</li>
        <li>How frequently each user views or interacts with their dashboard</li>
        <li>Approximate location derived from IP address (city/region level only, never precise GPS)</li>
        <li>Count of unique IP addresses that visit the site</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Automatically Collected Data</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address (used only for approximate location and abuse prevention)</li>
        <li>Browser type, device type, operating system, language preference</li>
        <li>Pages visited, time spent, and basic interaction events (clicks, scrolls)</li>
        <li>Referral source (where you came from)</li>
      </ul>

      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Private keys, seed phrases, or any sensitive wallet credentials</li>
        <li>Exact GPS coordinates</li>
        <li>Full browsing history outside our site</li>
        <li>
          Payment card details (if/when we add paid features, we will use a third-party processor)
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the data we collect only for these purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Service</li>
        <li>To authenticate you and keep your session secure</li>
        <li>To display your own wallet data and dashboard correctly</li>
        <li>To generate internal analytics for research purposes:</li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
        <li>How many people are using the tool</li>
        <li>How many wallets are being tracked per user</li>
        <li>Which features are used most often</li>
        <li>Rough geographic distribution of users (city/region level only)</li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
        <li>To detect and prevent abuse, spam, or malicious activity</li>
        <li>
          To communicate with you (only security notices, major updates, or product-related messages
          — we do <strong>not</strong> send marketing emails unless you explicitly opt in)
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>We do <strong>not</strong>:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Sell your personal data or wallet addresses to anyone</li>
        <li>Share identifiable data with advertisers</li>
        <li>Send you spam or promotional emails without consent</li>
        <li>Use your data for any purpose unrelated to running and improving Almstins</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Future Paid Features</h2>
      <p>We may eventually introduce paid features or subscriptions to cover server, database, API, and development costs. When that happens:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Payment processing will be handled by trusted third-party providers (e.g. Stripe)</li>
        <li>We will collect only the minimum billing information required by the processor</li>
        <li>We will clearly explain what is free vs paid before asking for payment</li>
        <li>Existing free users will not lose access to currently free features without advance notice</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This policy will be updated before any paid features launch.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell or rent your personal information.</p>
      <p>We may share data only in these limited cases:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>With service providers (e.g. Turso for database, hosting provider, email delivery) under strict confidentiality agreements</li>
        <li>To comply with valid legal requests (court order, subpoena, etc.)</li>
        <li>To protect the rights, property, or safety of Almstins, our users, or the public</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Account data is kept while your account is active</li>
        <li>Wallet addresses and related analytics are kept as long as you keep them in your dashboard</li>
        <li>You can delete your account and all associated data at any time (contact support or use the delete option when available)</li>
        <li>IP-based analytics and logs are kept for up to 12 months for abuse prevention and research</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Security</h2>
      <p>We use industry-standard practices to protect your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Encrypted database connections</li>
        <li>HTTPS everywhere</li>
        <li>Secure session handling</li>
        <li>Limited access to production data</li>
      </ul>
      <p>However, no system is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Rights &amp; Choices</h2>
      <p>You can:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Ask us to delete your account and associated data</li>
        <li>Opt out of any future marketing emails (we currently do not send any)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Contact: [your email address] or use the in-app support form when available.</p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy occasionally. We will post the new version here and update the
        "Last updated" date. Material changes will be communicated via the dashboard or email if you
        have one on file.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy?</p>
      <p>Email: [your email address]</p>

      <p>Thank you for using Almstins.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

